  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Mod Loaders-NeoForge/Fabric-green?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"266\" height=\"28\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/MincraftEinstein/ArmorTrimItemFix\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-Repository-blueviolet?style=for-the-badge&logo=github\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farmor-trim-item-fix\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-Page-1bd96a?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth\" width=\"166\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/gSsaFAvrBM\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-Einsteins Lab-blue?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Environment-Client-FF4500?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"185\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>📘 說明</strong></span></p>\n<p>Minecraft 中帶有紋飾的護甲物品會為所有物品顯示四種通用紋飾材質之一，無論你為物品添加何種紋飾，其材質始終相同。此模組透過新增會隨所套用紋飾而改變的額外物品紋飾材質來修正此問題。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>&nbsp;為 Fabric 版本之必要條件</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>支援 <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-armor-trims\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Armor Trims</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>📜 使用條款</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>允許事項</strong><br>✅ 將此模組作為參考資料，用於理解或創作出屬於自己的內容（只要非複製或重建即可）<br>✅ 在整合包中使用此模組時，請附上鳴謝及至少一個專案頁面連結*<br>✅ 為個人用途進行編輯<br>✅ 於 YouTube 影片中使用此模組時，請附上鳴謝及至少一個專案頁面連結*<br>✅ 為此模組建立資源包、數據包與擴充模組</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>禁止事項</strong><br>❌ 未經我明確許可，將此模組重新上傳或發布至任何網站，且需附上至少一個專案頁面連結*<br>❌ 未經我許可及鳴謝，重新分發此模組的已編輯或未編輯素材**</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>* 專案頁面包含 CurseForge、Modrinth、Planet Minecraft 與 GitHub<br>** 素材包含標誌、橫幅、材質、模型等</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9BG86Nc.png\" alt=\"範例\" width=\"480\" height=\"280\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmincrafteinstein\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/brandasset/kofi_bg_tag_dark.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"110\" height=\"42\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>想和朋友在伺服器上一起遊玩嗎？輸入代碼 <code>einstein</code> 即可獲得首月 15% 折扣。<br>點擊 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.net%252faff.php%253faff%253d124\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 或下方橫幅即可開始！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.net%252faff.php%253faff%253d124\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/u6Fn0I0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"316\"></a></p>",
